# Looking through a camera block: the eyes go to a still screen showing the camera, a right-stick flick switches camera,
# the stick up zooms, and holding Y returns to the character. Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1's two cameras from Earth Planet.
plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet

# ---- Setup: the head up, the world on the screen ---------------------------------------------------------------
admin creativeTools
# Earth Planet's ships belong to the world's own identity: the game lets the player control them once they own them
own Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1
# remote control and cameras reach a ship only through its antenna, which this one has off
switch Drill Ship Antenna on
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60
head 0 1.6 0
wait 2
headset world.png
expect headset bright

# ---- View through the bow camera (the terminal's View action, a setup step) -------------------------------------------
# the camera's View button in the terminal
control Camera Bow on Drill Ship Atmosphere mk.1
wait 2
expect log VR controls: camera over on foot within 5
expect log Forced view: on (the view is a camera block within 5
headset camera.png
expect headset changed

# ---- Flick the right stick right: the next camera, then left: the previous one ----------------------------------------
stick right 1 0
wait 0.3
stick right 0 0
wait 0.5
expect log Camera view: right stick flicked right, the next camera (SWITCH_RIGHT) within 5
stick right -1 0
wait 0.3
stick right 0 0
wait 0.5
expect log Camera view: right stick flicked left, the previous camera (SWITCH_LEFT) within 5

# ---- The stick up zooms in while held, down zooms out ----------------------------------------------------------------
stick right 0 1
wait 1
expect log Camera view: right stick: zoom in (CAMERA_ZOOM_IN) held within 5
stick right 0 0
wait 0.5
expect log Camera view: right stick: zoom let go within 5
stick right 0 -1
wait 1
expect log Camera view: right stick: zoom out (CAMERA_ZOOM_OUT) held within 5
stick right 0 0
wait 0.5

# ---- Hold Y: back to the character and the world ----------------------------------------------------------------------
press left b
wait 0.8
release left b
wait 2
expect log Forced view: over within 5
expect log VR controls: on foot within 5
headset back.png
expect headset changed
expect headset bright
